From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Port <port@local>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 22:05:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: vendor-prefixes: add the vendor prefixes in use

O device tree do board topaz usa prefixos de propriedade que nao estavam
em vendor-prefixes.yaml, e o dt-validate rejeita cada propriedade com
prefixo desconhecido: bat (fuel gauge vendor), synaptics (touchscreen),
fpc (fingerprint), mi/nopmi (Xiaomi), pd, sc, sm, vib, rt-tcpc e rt1711pd
(Richtek), typec, ln8000_charger, pin_assignment e signal.

---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
index af9a8d43b..e59afb9fd 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
@@ -204,6 +204,12 @@ patternProperties:
     description: BAIKAL ELECTRONICS, JSC
   "^bananapi,.*":
     description: BIPAI KEJI LIMITED
+  "^bat,.*":
+    description: Battery information used by the vendor fuel gauge
+
+  "^battery0,.*":
+    description: Per-battery instance properties used by the vendor charger
+
   "^beacon,.*":
     description: Compass Electronics Group, LLC
   "^beagle,.*":
@@ -527,6 +533,9 @@ patternProperties:
